Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Power of Kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 48
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That “Slowy” you’re in such a rush to find…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,can he really help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy is very knowledgeable; he’s sure to have a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly can I open this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won’t it open?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been locked in here for so many episodes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go rescue my kids; I can’t stay locked up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the kids okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really no way for me to open this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t exactly say “Open Sesame” to it, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be too silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you’re all safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We managed to find you so easily thanks to Pink showing us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t she an enemy? Why would she help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here’s the thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe something like this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely find a way to save your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can? That’s wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,that you would betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, look—even without using energy…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie and I successfully restored the dandelion’s color.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,they’ll find another way to save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t have time for trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The current plan is our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let anyone ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I let you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were too careless; we forgot Peach has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a basement full of traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who defies her gets trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie fell down with us. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This pipe has many branches leading to different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie must have fallen somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry and find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a mouse cursor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And it dragged me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trap set by Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach has set up many mechanical traps in these rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then isn’t it dangerous for Jonie to be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you new here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,W-who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re staying here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then…I accidentally passed through a rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wandered right into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, someone named Peach brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you got locked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn’t get locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve just been in our rooms doing what we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re actually kind of reluctant to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you’re here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you a resident of this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally stepped on Peach, and then she brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, did you see three people who look like this fall down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you were the only one who fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They have Pink leading the way; they should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll find a way to meet up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Since none of us are locked up anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s get out of here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is leaving this room? It’s full of Peach’s traps outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn’t get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to leave; there are so many plants that need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s all part of Peach’s trap—she wants everyone to stay here willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you want to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The garden back home needs me to look after it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s full of Peach’s traps out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An ordinary person really couldn’t make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m heading out now; if you want to leave, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her combat power comes from those gauntlets that unleash energy in response to emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As for her weakness…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s her kind nature and tendency to trust others too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely: your mission is to blend in with that crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and prevent them from escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No one who stumbles into this world is allowed to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,lest they interfere with our plan to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve already planted informants; there’s no escape for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Find a way to get close to Jonie and destroy her equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But why destroy her equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s a bad guy; without her equipment, she’s no longer a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we won’t have to worry about her stealing our energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I have other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Jonie’s equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there; we’ll be able to leave here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I was worrying unnecessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Jonie quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the three of us are struggling to deal with these traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Jonie is doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m being dragged away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Quick, save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re hurt; let me bandage that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s nothing. Getting out of here is the priority right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! We can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s free-form selection; once it catches you, there’s no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I’ll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These traps are impossible to dodge—I can’t get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening? I can’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you take my gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Peach specifically stationed me here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to destroy your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Absorption Device has finally been repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can restart our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so noisy over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they all gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what’s going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they all get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t I tell you to keep a close eye on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did Jonie go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking her side?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Peach specifically stationed me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you lose your gear, you won’t be able to steal our energy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn’t your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,whose home vanished because of the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their entire world was converted into energy and drained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the “energy of yours” that Peach spoke of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I don’t know exactly what they’re planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that is absolutely wrong; I can’t let you keep making this mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No…I don’t believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don’t seem like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If she is a bad person, she won’t be a threat once her gear is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we won’t have to worry about her stealing our energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the truth? Who exactly is lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll ask about the details myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go ask with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap like this can’t possibly hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to understand why you’re doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t as naïve as Dr. Peach made you out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to find a new way to save this world together with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, what exactly are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you trap everyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why absorb other people’s worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know why? I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,An abyss suddenly appeared in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It expanded rapidly, devouring everything around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse still, there wasn’t just one abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They kept appearing, endlessly consuming our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,until we discovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,energy from other worlds can halt the emergence and expansion of the abysses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I’ve done was to save my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we really were draining energy from other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe there must be a better way to save your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
